The '''Wizard''' is an [[NPC]] in [[The Catacombs - Floor IV]] (4)-[[The Catacombs - Floor VII|Floor VII]] (7) that can be found in a room with books. The first time you interact with him in the run, he will tell you that he has lost his [[Wizard's Crystal|Crystal Ball]] and that you have to retrieve it for him. The Crystal is located in a hidden lava cavern. After you have given his Crystal Ball back to him, he will grant you a [[Blessing|Blessing of Wisdom]].

